examples.solution_text:
$\begin{align*}\underset{\sim}{a}\cdot\underset{\sim}{b}&=(-3)(-2)+(4)(0)=6\\|\underset{\sim}{b}|^2&=(-2)^2=4\\\text{proj}_{\underset{\sim}{b}}\underset{\sim}{a}&=\frac{6}{4}\begin{pmatrix}-2\\0\end{pmatrix}\\&=\begin{pmatrix}-3\\0\end{pmatrix}\end{align*}$
The horizontal projection is $-3\underset{\sim}{i}$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=8mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\definecolor{projectionBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[black,->] (-4,0)--(1,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[black,->] (0,-0.5)--(0,5) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[black,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(-3,4) node[above left] {$\underset{\sim}{a}$};
\draw[black,dashed] (-3,4)--(-3,0);
\draw[projectionBlue,thick,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(-3,0);
\node[below] at (-2,-0.2) {$\text{proj}_{\underset{\sim}{b}}\underset{\sim}{a}=(-3,0)$};
\draw[black] (-3,0.25)--(-2.75,0.25)--(-2.75,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.question_text:
Given $|\overrightarrow{OA}|=12$ and $\angle AOB=30^{\circ}$, find the exact length of the projection of $\overrightarrow{OA}$ onto $\overrightarrow{OB}$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\draw[black,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(4.5,0) node[right] {$B$};
\draw[black,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(3.4641,2) node[above] {$A$};
\node[above left] at (1.73205,1) {$12$};
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\draw[black] (0.8,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=30,radius=0.8];
\node at (1.25,0.33) {$30^{\circ}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

examples.solution_text:
Dropping a perpendicular from $A$ to $OB$ gives a right triangle.
$\begin{align*}\left|\text{proj}_{\overrightarrow{OB}}\overrightarrow{OA}\right|&=|\overrightarrow{OA}|\cos30^{\circ}\\&=12\times\frac{\sqrt3}{2}\\&=6\sqrt3\end{align*}$
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\definecolor{projectionBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[black,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(4.5,0) node[right] {$B$};
\draw[black,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(3.4641,2) node[above] {$A$};
\node[above left] at (1.73205,1) {$12$};
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\draw[black,dashed] (3.4641,2)--(3.4641,0);
\draw[black] (3.2141,0)--(3.2141,0.25)--(3.4641,0.25);
\draw[projectionBlue,thick,-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(3.4641,0);
\node[below] at (1.73205,0) {$6\sqrt3$};
\draw[black] (0.8,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=30,radius=0.8];
\node at (1.25,0.33) {$30^{\circ}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
